+// Passes a copy of the audio through to another step (e.g. plots, spectrum, recording)
+// without changing it. The tapped step runs inline on the calling (pipeline) thread, in
+// exact 10 ms chunks, so it must be non-blocking; steps with blocking work (RecordStep's
+// file I/O) hand it off to their own thread.
 class TapStep : public IPipelineStep
 {
 public:
@@ -56,10 +56,11 @@ public:
